    <h2 class="sec-title">4-agent AI system<br>that runs autonomously.</h2>
    <p class="sec-desc">In 4 weeks, you deploy a multi-agent AI system, one orchestrator and four agents. Every action coordinated, traceable, and defined by you.</p>
    <div class="build-intro">One orchestrator → four specialist agents</div>
    <div class="build-grid">
      <div class="build-cell orchestrator">
        <div class="orchestrator-inner">
          <div class="cell-left"><p class="cell-letter">00</p></div>
          <div class="cell-right">
            <span class="cell-badge">The Brain</span>
            <p class="cell-title">Orchestrator Agent</p>
            <ul class="cell-list">
              <li>Receives every incoming trigger: email, schedule, or event</li>
              <li>Asks Claude which agent should handle it, then delegates accordingly</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="build-cell">
        <p class="cell-letter">01</p>
        <p class="cell-title">Reply Agent</p>
        <ul class="cell-list">
          <li>Reads every new email and classifies its intent</li>
          <li>Sends a reply in your style within your defined rules</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="build-cell">
        <p class="cell-letter">02</p>
        <p class="cell-title">Follow-Up Agent</p>
        <ul class="cell-list">
          <li>Checks the database and identifies what should be done</li>
          <li>Decides: who to contact, when, and how often</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="build-cell">
        <p class="cell-letter">03</p>
        <p class="cell-title">Outreach Agent</p>
        <ul class="cell-list">
          <li>Initiates outreach to new or cold contacts based on your criteria</li>
          <li>Personalises each message and logs every send to the decision log</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="build-cell">
        <p class="cell-letter">04</p>
        <p class="cell-title">Performance Agent</p>
        <ul class="cell-list">
          <li>Routes risky or high-value cases to a human for review</li>
          <li>Monitors and reports the quality of every AI decision across all agents</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

