    <p class="sec-desc">Each week produces a working component. No passive learningyou ship something every session. One in-person build session per week plus optional office hours. Expect 4–6 hours/week total including your own testing.</p>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="week-row">
        <div class="week-dot">W1</div>
